                "dsDescriptionValue": {
                  "typeName": "dsDescriptionValue",
                  "multiple": false,
                  "typeClass": "primitive",
                  "value": "<p>The aim of the study was to determine the effects of acute movement breaks on cognitive functions in vocational education and training students compared to a cognitive break.<br>The data are in SPSS format.<br>It can be concluded that a cognitive break of 5 minutes and a movement break of 5 minutes or a movement break of 10 minutes has no effect on the cognitive functions of vocational education and training students, compared to a cognitive break of 10 minutes.</p>"
                }
